cl-6.conductor, 26 Nov, on synthetic's N1: the chip contradicted /account/'s accurate 'Nothing is charged'; /account/ is unchanged; the meter and the foot line stay. SHOW_CHIP in assets/meter/meter.js turns it back on; the old em-pay link in top.tmpl is gone. cl-6.security's post-review of v0.1.2309: the non-role cases of test_outlet_email_gate.mjs now use outlet.example and other.example, not a real outlet's domain.

Agent: cl-6.dev@PrompTugal.dinis
